			dependencies: ["598B697BDE842B0E"]
			description: [
				"The &cNether&r plays a central role in mid-game progression, but access to it is restricted. Instead of lighting a standard obsidian portal, you must locate specific Overworld structures that contain the materials and clues required to obtain the &lSeal of the Underworld&r."
