		{
			dependencies: ["4196DD5F26401205"]
			description: [
				"With the &cSeal of the Underworld&r in hand, you are ready to progress into the next major stage of your journey. Consuming the seal removes the dimensional barrier and activates the Nether portal, granting access to one of the most resource-rich and hazardous environments in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"This transition marks a significant milestone, preparing you for advanced materials, specialized structures, and mid-game challenges that define Nether progression."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Before entering, ensure you have adequate equipment, supplies, and preparation for the heat, terrain, and hostile encounters that await."
				""
				"The &cNether&r is designed to test your readiness and push your progression forward."
