		{
			dependencies: ["3F3994EDD215FC99"]
			description: [
				"&cYou’ve broken the seal and entered the Nether&r—an environment defined by danger, heat, and limited safe zones. Establishing stability early on is essential for progressing through this dimension."
				""
				"Your first objective is resource acquisition. Create a &esafe perimeter&r around your portal, mark your &dreturn location&r, and begin gathering essential Nether materials such as quartz, gold, and glowstone. These resources support brewing, crafting, automation components, and mid-game advancement within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Organizing and stockpiling these materials strengthens your early presence and prepares you for deeper exploration."
				""
				"The included &bLodestone&r and &bCompass&r rewards ensure reliable navigation, allowing you to relocate your base even within the Nether’s complex cave systems and hazardous terrain."
				""
				"Securing these foundational resources establishes your foothold in this hostile dimension and prepares you for the challenges ahead."
			]
