				""
				"Collect &8Blackstone&r as an alternative to stone for tool and block crafting. Use &4Crimson&r and &2Warped Wood&r for fire-resistant building materials that reduce structural risk in high-heat environments. Gather &6Gold&r to safely interact with Piglins and to support crafting recipes tied to mid-game progression."
