				"&8Nether Fortresses&r are critical progression structures within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. These strongholds contain essential resources and materials required for brewing, mid-game crafting, and advancing further into Nether Remastered content."
				""
				"Hostile mobs such as &6Blazes&r, &8Wither Skeletons&r, and groups of &eZombie Piglins&r patrol the corridors, making careful preparation and reliable equipment necessary before entering."
