		{
			dependencies: ["1D6068D3F034486B"]
			description: [
				"Bastion Remnants are high-risk, high-reward structures found throughout the &cNether&r. These ruined strongholds contain large quantities of &6gold&r, valuable loot, rare materials, and late-game gear that support multiple progression paths within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"Inside, &6Piglins&r and &cPiglin Brutes&r enforce strict territorial control. Brutes attack on sight, dealing significant damage and requiring strong equipment and careful strategy to defeat. Understanding Piglin behavior and preparing appropriate defenses is essential before entering."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Exploring a Bastion can provide powerful rewards, including enchanted gear, weapon upgrades, and materials needed for potioncraft and advanced crafting systems. Each room presents unique hazards, encouraging deliberate navigation and situational awareness."
				""
				"Enter only when prepared—Bastions test both combat readiness and resource planning, but the rewards significantly strengthen your mid-game progression."
