				"&6Ancient Debris&r is one of the rarest and most valuable resources found within the &cNether&r, serving as the foundation for crafting &8Netherite&r—the highest tier of gear available in standard progression. Its rarity and distribution make it a key milestone in preparing for late-game challenges."
				""
				"Ancient Debris most commonly generates near &eY-Level 15&r. Mining it effectively requires careful planning, awareness of lava pockets, and methods such as controlled explosions to clear large areas safely. Patience and preparation significantly increase your efficiency when searching for this material."
