			x: -13.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["638EF7DB16108237"]
			description: [
				"The &0Deep Dark&r is a biome defined by low visibility, sculk-based detection systems, and the constant threat of triggering hostile activity. Light sources are limited in effectiveness, and sound plays a critical role in determining your safety."
				""
				"As you enter this region, movement must be deliberate. Sculk sensors and shriekers react to vibration, alerting nearby threats and escalating the danger with each activation. Navigating quietly is essential to avoiding confrontation and maintaining control of your surroundings."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Your initial objective is survival—observe the environment, manage noise carefully, and identify safe paths through the terrain. Building familiarity with these mechanics prepares you for the deeper challenges that await within the Ancient Cities."
				""
				"The descent marks the beginning of your progression through one of the world’s most dangerous biomes."
			]
