		{
			dependencies: ["516EFC067D776C8A"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the world lies the &8Ancient City&r, a large structure filled with valuable loot, unique materials, and key components for late-game progression in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. These ruins are densely packed with sculk sensors and shriekers, making noise management essential for survival."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &cWarden&r responds to repeated sound triggers and can be summoned if sensors are activated too frequently. Once alerted, it becomes a major threat capable of overwhelming unprepared players. Navigating quietly and planning each movement reduces the risk of an encounter."
				""
				"Exploring the Ancient City offers significant rewards, but requires awareness, caution, and proper equipment. Treat each section as a controlled challenge—collect what you need, avoid unnecessary noise, and maintain escape routes when possible."
				""
