		{
			dependencies: ["7964AB0D39902EFA"]
			description: [
				"The &5End Portal&r marks the transition into one of the most challenging stages of progression within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. Activating the portal grants access to the End Dimension, where both the terrain and its inhabitants demand thorough preparation."
				""
				"The initial objective upon entry is the confrontation with the &cEnder Dragon&r. This encounter has been enhanced to provide a more demanding experience, requiring reliable equipment, strong defensive options, and a clear strategy for managing both ground and aerial phases of the fight."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Ensure you have adequate armor, ranged and melee tools, mobility items, and consumables tailored to long engagements. Understanding crystal placement, environmental hazards, and dragon attack patterns will significantly increase your chances of success."
				""
				"This battle represents a major progression milestone. Enter only when fully prepared, as retreat is not an option once you step through."
				""
				"Proceed with caution and confidence—the path forward begins here."
			]
