		{
			dependencies: ["59AB4308055958B4"]
			description: [
				"The enhanced &cEnder Dragon&r presents one of the most demanding encounters in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. Its increased aggression, improved movement patterns, and higher damage output require a well-prepared loadout and a clear combat strategy."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Begin the encounter by eliminating the &dEnd Crystals&r located on the obsidian towers. These crystals regenerate the dragon’s health, making them the first critical objective. Use ranged tools or controlled climbing to reach each crystal safely."
				""
				"Once the crystals are destroyed, focus on maintaining consistent damage while managing the dragon’s aerial sweeps, projectile attacks, and knockback effects. Keep awareness of the void edges and use mobility tools to reposition when necessary."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A &6Totem of Undying&r, strong armor, and adequate healing supplies significantly increase survivability during the encounter."
				""
				"Defeating the dragon marks a major progression milestone and grants access to the outer islands and the endgame materials required for advanced crafting and exploration."
			]
