		{
			dependencies: ["6720A599B8A32D97"]
			description: [
				"Defeating the &cEnder Dragon&r opens access to the &dEnd Gateway&r—your method of reaching the Outer End. This structure appears above the central island and serves as the transition point to a new region of the End Dimension."
				""
				"The gateway leads to the &5Outer End&r, an expansive area composed of scattered islands, End Cities, and valuable late-game resources that support advanced crafting and equipment upgrades within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To enter, simply throw an &eEnder Pearl&r into the portal. Upon arrival, be prepared for varied terrain, wide void spaces, and hostile mobs that require careful movement and planning."
				""
				"The Outer End contains critical materials and structure-based loot needed for further progression. Exploration here rewards preparation, mobility tools, and awareness of environmental hazards."
				""
				"Continue your advancement by uncovering the secrets and resources found within this region."
			]
