		{
			dependencies: ["75E010388EA41A77"]
			description: [
				"End Cities are large structures found throughout the Outer End and serve as a major progression point within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. These towering complexes contain valuable loot, enchanted gear, rare building materials, and the &bElytra&r—a key mobility upgrade that unlocks advanced exploration opportunities across all dimensions."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Navigating End Cities requires caution. &5Shulkers&r guard the interiors and exterior platforms, using projectiles that inflict levitation. This effect can shift positioning dramatically, making fall damage a significant risk without proper planning or equipment."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/end_city.png width:192 height:150 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Securing the Elytra, typically found within End Ships, marks a major advancement in traversal and resource gathering. With it, long-distance travel, high-altitude building, and interdimensional mobility become substantially more efficient."
				""
				"Approach each structure deliberately, manage vertical movement carefully, and be prepared for extended combat. The rewards gained here significantly strengthen your late-game capabilities."
			]
