		{
			dependencies: ["2C9F0702A802DBE0"]
			description: [
				"The End contains several rare materials that play a critical role in late-game crafting and engineering within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. These resources appear throughout the End Islands and support advanced upgrades, structural components, and specialized crafting pathways."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Key materials include:"
				""
				"- &dRadiantite&r: A concentrated crystal form of End energy used in tool enhancements and high-tier components.  "
				"- &7Void Shale&r: A durable stone variant ideal for advanced building applications and reinforced structures.  "
				"- &fPalerock Vents&r: Geological formations infused with dimensional residue, capable of producing unique byproducts used in endgame crafting."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Each material contributes to systems and recipes that extend beyond standard progression, forming the foundation for late-game equipment and technological development."
				""
				"Locate these resources, gather them efficiently, and incorporate them into your crafting pipeline. They are essential for advancing toward the final stages of your journey through Forge Frontier."
			]
