				"Defeating the &cEnder Dragon&r and securing resources such as &dRadiantite&r, &7Void Shale&r, and &fPalerock&r marks the beginning of true endgame progression within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. These materials form the core components required for constructing the &6Tier 5 Rocket&r."
				""
				"This rocket represents a significant advancement in engineering, utilizing rare End-based resources to enable travel far beyond the boundaries of traditional planets. Its construction demands careful automation, refined material processing, and a strong foundation in late-game crafting systems."
